  "name": "Native archetype uploads apply shared signatures and charge for omitted purchases",
  "contract": "ChrSpecs 26 (Sanguine) uses shared entry 29543 for Scarlet Delirium 801074; ChrSpecs 99 (Eternal) uses\nshared entry 31117 for Blood Pact 801955. Each costs 1 AE; the level-11 Bloodmage budget is 1 AE / 1 TE.\nOriginal DLL LeaveSpec removes the old signature and EnterSpec inserts the new signature and identity\ninto the complete CMSG 0x727 upload. Rotclaw 30191 (804197, 1 TE) has no FREE_UNLEARN flag. The original\nlevel-11 first unlearn price is 32 * 11 / 4 = 88 copper. A penniless switch must refuse atomically. A\nfunded switch applies exactly the uploaded identity and signature, charges 88 copper, and removes\nRotclaw. Returning with only identity and signature must leave the omitted purchase absent, with no\nadditional signature-removal charge. An explicit native purchase restores Rotclaw. Saved specialization\nslots are separate presets.",
